  "2026-10-29T18:12:00.283Z",codex,"Verified merged delivery PRs 195 and 196 and their exact-head passing CI receipts. Both owning items were still in_progress with no release field. As explicitly authorized for recovery, append-only pinned CLI updates close those delivered items and pin release 2026.10.29. npm run changelog:full now generates the exact 2026.10.29 - 2026-10-29 section with both entries; version and workflows are unchanged. Revert proof: origin/main lacks the requested heading; the same generator command after metadata repair emits it. Recovery item remains in progress for orchestrator verification; no merge or dispatch."
  "2026-10-29T18:13:41.473Z",codex-agent,"Linked npm run changelog:check passed 1/1 command. Prior source/dist and release gates were green on delivered PRs; the recovery branch will require fresh exact-head npm and Bun full release gates at unchanged thresholds in CI. Generated notes contain exactly the two recovered delivery entries; all earlier release sections are retained. Test-result tracking is disabled, so this append-only comment retains the receipt."
